# This repository is PUBLIC (github.com/spencerfrei/spencerfrei.github.io).
# Anything committed here is world-readable and permanent in git history.
#
# The rules below cover files that were sitting untracked in this working tree
# and would have been published by a single `git add .`. None were ever
# committed, so ignoring them is fully effective.

# ---- Student records: names and grades. Never publish. ----
grades/
**/grades/
roster*.csv
*_gradescope.csv

# ---- Files explicitly marked as not for publication ----
PRIVATE_*
**/PRIVATE_*
*dontupload*

# ---- LaTeX build artifacts ----
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.bcf
*.run.xml
texput.log

# ---- Editor/office lock files ----
.~lock.*#
